        "category": "ancestry",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've learned to embody your mercurial nature, changing size to fit in better with mortal folk. You can spend 1 minute to become Small if you're Tiny, or vice versa. The transformation lasts until you use Fickle Form again.</p><hr /><p><strong>Special</strong> If you have the pixie sprite heritage or another heritage that makes you Small, you can become Medium or Tiny if you're Small, and can become Small if you're Medium.</p>"
